<title>PHILIPPINES: Planters Bank sets 9.689 peso cash div.</title>
<headline>Planters Bank sets 9.689 peso cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Planters Development Bank had set a 9.689 peso cash dividend to be given to its class C shareholders as of March 31, the Philippine Stock Exchange said in an advisory on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The ex-cash date had been set on March 18, the bourse said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841 8938 Fax 817 6267</p>
</text>
